ttings are left out of the comparison on purpose.** With old move and memo both on, the C runs both and the Python drops the memo. And the C lists customers with no products as free moves at the root, while the Python leaves them out. Both differences predate this change, so witnesses are compared over active customers only.\n- **`tests/test_repaired_rules.py`** now has 16 tests, 6 of them new for the C. The gate passes: lake build, one `sorry` (the baseline), 1,343 MOSP tests and 95 pathwidth_solver tests.\n\nThe item 02 section is in `paper2/solver_fix.md`. PROGRESS.md reads 2/10 SOLVED, with notes for item 03, and item 02 is marked `[x]` in iterations.md. Nothing was committed and nothing was written to `solutions/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1766,"cache_read_input_tokens":154429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1766,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a362c8d-d55d-49a8-94ae-8e8efcb8a09f","uuid":"533123b9-36ea-4372-9551-4f3c4b4a5ae8","timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:11:25.831Z","request_id":"req_011Cfbeo9mSdCCGh75V6ecd6"}
